# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #dynamic: a field of data and the value of a free input are different places, a coincidence
# of names copies nothing; a declaration with no initializer sets no invented value): x: y reads the free y of the
# unit, 40; the later int: y of S declares the place y of D and writes nothing, so D\y keeps 7. Entry 7.
int: y 40
S:
    int: x 0
    x: y
    int: y
end: S
D:
    int: x 0
    int: y 7
end: D
call: S D
int: r 81
if: D\x = 40 && D\y = 7
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
